  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **Ween2005-07-16.bobbybourbon** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 92 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- First show after a nine-month break for the band; it was a daytime show [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Ween2005-07-16.bobbybourbon**: Taped with Schoeps MK4V microphones without windscreens, run through SX-M2 and SBM1 at 24-bit, then D100, CDR, EAC, FLAC; Disc one was mastered with left and right channels inverted, then switched back to normal at home [1]",
